===== gwi gmail draft =====
Manages Gmail drafts; never sends or deletes one (mirrors the `gmail_draft_list`/`gmail_draft_show` MCP tools for `list`/`show`; `create`/`update` are CLI-only; rust-works/omni-dev#1920)

Usage: gwi gmail draft [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
