===== gwi drive permissions =====
Inspects the write-permission rules gating `drive create`/`upload`/`edit`, `drive sheets write`/`append`/`clear`/`create` and `drive docs replace`/`append`/`create` (issues rust-works/omni-dev#1574, rust-works/omni-dev#1589, rust-works/omni-dev#1612, rust-works/omni-dev#1615)

