Usage: gwi drive sheets update-sheet-properties [OPTIONS] --sheet <NAME> <--freeze-rows <N>|--freeze-columns <N>|--tab-color <HEX>|--clear-tab-color|--right-to-left <BOOL>|--hide-gridlines <BOOL>> <SPREADSHEET_ID>

