Shuffles the row order within a range into an order chosen by the server. Gated by the folder `sheets-write` **and** `sheets-structure` operations (issue rust-works/omni-dev#1845, ADR-0083 §§3, 5, 6) — a reordered row was measured carrying its formatting, notes and data-validation rules with it. The resulting order can never be previewed; see `randomize-range --help`

